# Vulnerabilities the image scan (.github/workflows/image.yml) is allowed to ignore.
#
# The scan already skips findings with no available fix (--ignore-unfixed), so an entry here
# means a fix EXISTS but cannot be taken yet. Every entry needs a justification and an expiry,
# so it cannot be forgotten:
#
#   # Why this is not exploitable here, and what unblocks the upgrade.
#   CVE-2099-12345 exp:2099-01-31
#
# (No entries.)
